{"repositoryId":84183882,"availability":"available","full":"google/sentencepiece","name":"sentencepiece","description":"Unsupervised text tokenizer for Neural Network-based text generation.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"C++","stars":12125,"forks":1385,"created":"2017-03-07T10:03:48Z","updated":"2026-10-12T07:10:30Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://google.github.io/sentencepiece/","topics":["natural-language-processing","neural-machine-translation","word-segmentation"],"demo":"https://google.github.io/sentencepiece/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T09:42:00.087Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T09:42:00.087Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T09:42:00.087Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T09:42:00.087Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"curated-list","name":"Awesome Machine Learning","url":"https://github.com/josephmisiti/awesome-machine-learning"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-12T09:42:00.087Z","stars":12125,"forks":1385}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["SentencePiece is a fast, lightweight, and unsupervised text tokenizer and detokenizer designed for neural network-based text generation systems (such as Large Language Models) where the vocabulary size is fixed prior to training.","It implements subword units—including Byte-Pair-Encoding (BPE) [Sennrich et al.] and the unigram language model [Kudo.]—with the ability to train directly from raw sentences. By treating input text as a raw sequence of Unicode characters, SentencePiece enables a purely end-to-end, language-independent pipeline that completely eliminates the need for language-specific pre- or post-processing.","While the core tokenization (C++ or Rust) runs in parallel, the final step of converting the native results (C++ vector of vectors or Rust vector of vectors) into Python objects (list[list[int]] or list[Encoding]) is sequential and must be done on Python's main thread (GIL-locked). At high thread counts, this single-threaded serialization step becomes the dominant bottleneck, capping the scaling performance."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/google/sentencepiece/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"b484d2bb25c7f61d8cdee09ac8e011807a7e4efe19eb364de4a61450bea04b59","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T09:42:00.087Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T09:42:00.087Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"SentencePiece is a fast, lightweight, and unsupervised text tokenizer and detokenizer designed for neural network-based text generation systems (such as Large Language Models) where the vocabulary size is fixed prior to training.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/google/sentencepiece/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[{"text":"SentencePiece is a fast, lightweight, and unsupervised text tokenizer and detokenizer designed for neural network-based text generation systems (such as Large Language Models) where the vocabulary size is fixed prior to training.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/google/sentencepiece/blob/master/README.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"b484d2bb25c7f61d8cdee09ac8e011807a7e4efe19eb364de4a61450bea04b59","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/google/sentencepiece/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T09:42:00.087Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-12T07:10:30Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/google/sentencepiece/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T09:49:56.743Z","hash":"b484d2bb25c7f61d8cdee09ac8e011807a7e4efe19eb364de4a61450bea04b59","originalBytes":9702,"storedBytes":9702,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["sentencepiece","python","text","doc","model","threads","lite","performance","raw","benchmark","c++","ids","pieces","readme.md","fast","guide","output","print","subword","tokenizer","vocabulary","bpe","detokenization","directly","girl","input","language","license","list","lossless","models","reference","runtime","saw","size","thread","tokenization","unigram","api","c